      "title": "Time to next predicted breach",
      "description": "Minutes until the soonest predicted breach among open/acknowledged alerts, computed live by GET /alerts/summary (negative = predicted time has passed). Red below 10 min: act now (REQ-E target lead time). Empty = no active alerts.",
